  "abstract": "This is the second experiment in the systematic 'Hard Constraint Seeding' series. The first experiment, locking pair (8, 13), led to the discovery of a near-SOTA packing (~2.635977). This experiment continues the exploration by targeting the third-closest near-contact pair from the Scientia II baseline: (6, 12). The method remains the same: lock the target pair into a touching state and re-optimize the remaining 24 circles. The goal is to discover another novel, high-potential structural basin.",
